{"abstract":[{"text":"Create robust apps by describing output you want programmatically.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/technologies","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/generating-swift-data-structures-with-guided-generation"},"kind":"article","legalNotices":{"copyright":"Copyright &copy; 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.","privacyPolicy":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/privacy\/privacy-policy","termsOfUse":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/legal\/internet-services\/terms\/site.html"},"metadata":{"availableLanguages":["de-DE","en-US","es-419","fr-FR","it-IT","ja-JP","ko-KR","pt-BR","zh-CN"],"modules":[{"name":"Foundation Models"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Generating Swift data structures with guided generation"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you perform a request, the model returns a raw string in its natural language","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"format. Raw strings require you to manually parse the details you want. Instead of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"working with raw strings, the framework provides guided generation, which gives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"strong guarantees that the response is in a format you expect.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To use guided generation, describe the output you want as a new Swift type.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When you make a request to the model, include your custom type and the framework","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"performs the work necessary to fill in and return an object with the parameters filled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in for you. The framework uses constrained sampling when generating output, which defines","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the rules on what the model can generate. Constrained sampling prevents the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model from producing malformed output and provides you with results as a type you define.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For more information about creating a session and prompting the model, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/generating-content-and-performing-tasks-with-foundation-models","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Conform-your-data-type-to-Generable","level":2,"text":"Conform your data type to Generable","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To conform your type to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Generable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", describe the type and the parameters to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guide the response of the model. The framework supports generating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content with basic Swift types like ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bool","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Decimal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Array","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For example, if you only want the model to return a numeric result, call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelSession\/respond(to:generating:includeSchemaInPrompt:options:)-13kji","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using the type ","type":"text"},{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let prompt = \"How many tablespoons are in a cup?\"","let session = LanguageModelSession(model: .default)","","\/\/ Generate a response with the type `Float`, instead of `String`.","let response = try await session.respond(to: prompt, generating: Float.self)"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A schema provides the ability to control the values of a property, and you can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specify guides to control values you associate with it. The framework provides two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"macros that help you with schema creation. Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Generable(description:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on structures, actors, and enumerations; and only use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Guide(description:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stored properties.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you add descriptions to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" properties, you help the model understand","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the semantics of the properties. Keep the descriptions as short as possible — long","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"descriptions take up additional context size and can introduce latency. The following","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example creates a type that describes a cat and includes a name, an age that’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constrained to a range of values, and a short profile:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Generable(description: \"Basic profile information about a cat\")","struct CatProfile {","    \/\/ A guide isn't necessary for basic fields.","    var name: String","","    @Guide(description: \"The age of the cat\", .range(0...20))","    var age: Int","","    @Guide(description: \"A one sentence profile about the cat's personality\")","    var profile: String","}"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The model generates ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" properties in the order they’re declared.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can nest custom ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" types inside other ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" types, and mark","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enumerations with associated values as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" macro ensures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that all associated and nested values are themselves generable. This allows for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"advanced use cases like creating complex data types or dynamically generating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views at runtime.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Make-a-request-with-your-custom-data-type","level":2,"text":"Make a request with your custom data type","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After creating your type, use it along with a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelSession","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to prompt the model. When you use a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" type it prevents the model","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from producing malformed output and prevents the need for any manual string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parsing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Generate a response using a custom type.","let response = try await session.respond(","    to: \"Generate a cute rescue cat\",","    generating: CatProfile.self",")"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"anchor":"Define-a-dynamic-schema-at-runtime","level":2,"text":"Define a dynamic schema at runtime","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you don’t know what you want the model to produce at compile time use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/DynamicGenerationSchema","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to define what you need. For example,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when you’re working on a restaurant app and want to restrict the model to pick","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from menu options that a restaurant provides. Because each restaurant provides a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"different menu, the schema won’t be known in its entirety until runtime.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Create the dynamic schema at runtime.","let menuSchema = DynamicGenerationSchema(","    name: \"Menu\",","    properties: [","        DynamicGenerationSchema.Property(","            name: \"dailySoup\",","            schema: DynamicGenerationSchema(","                name: \"dailySoup\",","                anyOf: [\"Tomato\", \"Chicken Noodle\", \"Clam Chowder\"]","            )","        )","","        \/\/ Add additional properties.","    ]",")"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After creating a dynamic schema, use it to create a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/GenerationSchema","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that you provide with your request. When you try to create a generation schema,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it can throw an error if there are conflicting property names, undefined","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"references, or duplicate types.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Create the schema.","let schema = try GenerationSchema(root: menuSchema, dependencies: [])","","\/\/ Pass the schema to the model to guide the output.","let response = try await session.respond(","    to: \"The prompt you want to make.\",","    schema: schema",")"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The response you get is an instance of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/GeneratedContent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". You can decode the outputs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from schemas you define at runtime by calling ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/GeneratedContent\/value(_:forProperty:)-3xsez","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the property you want.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Structured-output","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Generable(description:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Guide(description:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Generable","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/GenerationSchema","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/DynamicGenerationSchema","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/GeneratedContent","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/ConvertibleToGeneratedContent","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/ConvertibleFromGeneratedContent"],"title":"Structured output"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/generating-swift-data-structures-with-guided-generation"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/technologies","kind":"technologies","role":"overview","title":"Technologies","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/technologies"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels":{"abstract":[{"text":"Perform tasks with models that specialize in language understanding, structured output, and tool calling.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels","images":[{"identifier":"foundation-models-framework-landing-PageImage-card.png","type":"card"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Foundation Models"}],"role":"collection","title":"Foundation Models","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels"},"doc://com.apple.foun